---
---
<header
      class="relative pt-32 pb-20 px-6 lg:px-12 overflow-hidden flex flex-col items-center text-center"
    >
      <div
        class="absolute top-1/2 left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 w-[600px] h-[600px] bg-emerald-600/20 rounded-full blur-[150px] pointer-events-none"
      >
      </div>

      <div
        class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-emerald-500/10 text-emerald-400 ring-1 ring-emerald-500/20 text-xs font-mono mb-8"
      >
        <span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-emerald-500 animate-pulse"></span>
        v0.0.1-beta.1 (C++17 / Native JSI)
      </div>

      <h1 class="text-5xl md:text-7xl font-extrabold text-white tracking-tight mb-6 max-w-4xl">
        Seguridad Zero-Trust para <span
          class="text-transparent bg-clip-text bg-gradient-to-r from-emerald-400 to-cyan-400"
          >React Native</span
        >
      </h1>

      <p class="text-lg md:text-xl text-slate-400 mb-10 max-w-2xl leading-relaxed">
        Librería criptográfica de grado militar compilada nativamente. Firmas DPoP asimétricas y
        limpieza de memoria estricta (Zeroization) operando por debajo del motor V8/Hermes mediante
        JSI Bridge.
      </p>

      <div class="flex gap-4">
        <a
          href="#quickstart"
          class="bg-emerald-600 hover:bg-emerald-500 text-white font-semibold py-3 px-8 rounded-full transition-all hover:scale-105 shadow-lg shadow-emerald-900/20"
        >
          Ver Documentación
        </a>
        <a
          href="/register"
          class="bg-slate-800 hover:bg-slate-700 text-white border border-slate-700 font-semibold py-3 px-8 rounded-full transition-all"
        >
          Generar Bundle ID
        </a>
      </div>
    </header>